  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/242/379/64/64/637134045284508458.png\" alt=\"Auth Me 圖示\"></p><h1>身份驗證模組 (Auth Me)</h1><p>在 Minecraft 中驗證您的身份並重新驗證您的連線階段</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/actions/workflows/release.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/axieum/authme/release.yml?branch=main&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"建置狀態\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/axieum/authme?style=for-the-badge&amp;include_prereleases&amp;sort=semver\" alt=\"版本發布\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auth-me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/Available For_356643_latest.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"適用版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auth-me/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_356643_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"下載次數\"></a></p><p>Auth Me 是一個<strong>Minecraft 模組</strong>，將帳號驗證功能帶入遊戲中，致力於解決連線至伺服器時常見的連線階段驗證錯誤問題。</p><p>這是<strong>僅限客戶端</strong>的模組，適用於現代版本的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft</a> Java 版。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/blob/main/demo.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Auth Me 演示\"></p><h4>替代方案</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TechnicianLP/ReAuth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ReAuth</a> by TechnicianLP</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Sintinium/oauth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OAuth</a> by Sintinium</li>\n</ul><h2>贊助商</h2><p>我們要特別感謝以下贊助商對 Auth Me 開發的支持。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252faxieum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/b9fe4fbe-8cc4-42cc-a545-dfd1b46d20e6.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p><h2>貢獻</h2><p>感謝您考慮為 Auth Me 做出貢獻！請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/blob/main/.github/CONTRIBUTING.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">貢獻指南</a>。</p><h2>安全性漏洞</h2><p>請查閱<a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/blob/main/.github/SECURITY.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">安全性政策</a>了解如何回報安全性漏洞。</p><h2>授權條款</h2><p>Auth Me 是採用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopensource.org%252flicenses%252fMIT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 授權條款</a>的開源軟體。</p>",
